  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Heterogeneous one-server P4D4: the prefill role is four HBF-GPU cards (one tp4 replica; weights and committed KV in HBF, activations and active-turn KV in wide LPDDR at 409.6 GB/s per card, matching the repo's established wide-LPDDR design point) and the decode role is four H100s.  The prefill cards are H100-class dies on the same NVLink/NVSwitch fabric as the decode GPUs, so intra_fabric is 450 GB/s per card and the root values are NVSwitch-class (1800 GB/s) rather than PCIe.  The gpu section is the P4D4 substrate: D-side HBM, the NVLink handoff fabric, and the shared SSDs.  Its cpu_memory_* fields are overridden at load time by the HBF home tier (virtual_hbf_tier_hardware).",
